WEBVTT

00:00:07.220 --> 00:00:13.880
<i>A new kind of disease has been 
spreading among young people.</i>

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:17.280
<i>Following prolonged 
periods of Internet usage,</i>

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:23.140
<i>sufferers develop a pathological 
dependence on the Internet.</i>

00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:27.880
<i>Experts have named this 
disease "Internet Addiction."</i>

00:00:28.790 --> 00:00:34.890
<i>In order to get these addicted 
youngsters back on the right track</i>

00:00:34.890 --> 00:00:39.140
<i>and reform them into independent, 
self-respecting adults,</i>

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:45.890
<i>the Elite Reeducation Academy, 
a civilian educational facility, was created.</i>

00:00:46.940 --> 00:00:53.740
<i>It is a place to help young 
people to grow up right.</i>

00:02:27.540 --> 00:02:32.420
Episode 5 
Their Parting of the Ways

00:02:29.430 --> 00:02:32.410
Use your strengths to exploit 
their weaknesses.

00:02:32.780 --> 00:02:34.460
If you can do that,

00:02:35.170 --> 00:02:37.500
you'll be a loser no longer.

00:02:45.260 --> 00:02:47.380
Damn. He's incredible.

00:02:47.980 --> 00:02:50.940
He can run that far, and still hit people...

00:02:51.260 --> 00:02:52.940
How much stamina has he got?

00:03:04.570 --> 00:03:06.680
That son of a...

00:03:06.680 --> 00:03:07.940
Circle around to the other end.

00:03:07.940 --> 00:03:09.800
We'll trap him.

00:03:11.860 --> 00:03:13.660
This is a dead end!

00:03:13.660 --> 00:03:14.920
I got you!

00:03:18.700 --> 00:03:19.620
What the hell?

00:03:19.620 --> 00:03:21.430
He's as slippery as a fish!

00:03:27.450 --> 00:03:28.610
Go! Quick!

00:03:28.610 --> 00:03:29.760
Don't let him get away!

00:03:31.150 --> 00:03:32.230
What the hell happened?

00:03:32.230 --> 00:03:32.810
Mung beans!

00:03:32.810 --> 00:03:34.440
He spread mung beans on the ground!

00:03:34.730 --> 00:03:36.940
And thumbtacks, too!

00:03:38.940 --> 00:03:40.440
Damn it!

00:03:41.100 --> 00:03:43.300
Well, isn't this interesting?

00:03:43.300 --> 00:03:46.410
I'm gonna kill you, no matter what!

00:03:57.560 --> 00:03:59.800
Okay, it's time.

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:01.890
Lucky you, you made it just in time.

00:04:01.890 --> 00:04:03.400
Yeah, I'm exhausted.

00:04:03.400 --> 00:04:06.180
But you won't get away this time.

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:08.410
Open the door!

00:04:08.410 --> 00:04:09.440
Let us inside!

00:04:09.440 --> 00:04:10.940
Open the door!

00:04:10.940 --> 00:04:13.160
B-Big Bro, why did you lock the door?

00:04:13.160 --> 00:04:15.200
Curfew is 9:00 PM.

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:16.980
Don't pretend you didn't know.

00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:18.420
The rest of you can sleep outside.

00:04:18.420 --> 00:04:20.000
Don't be like that, Big Bro!

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:22.130
Rules are rules.

00:04:22.130 --> 00:04:23.680
Got it?

00:04:32.890 --> 00:04:36.200
I can handle trash like you all by myself.

00:04:36.200 --> 00:04:37.980
I'll beat you black and blue!

00:04:42.590 --> 00:04:43.920
What's so funny?

00:04:45.440 --> 00:04:47.500
You may be by yourself,

00:04:47.500 --> 00:04:49.430
but I'm not.

00:04:52.950 --> 00:04:53.990
W-Wait.

00:04:53.990 --> 00:04:55.210
Wait a minute!

00:04:55.210 --> 00:04:56.430
Stop it!

00:05:00.130 --> 00:05:01.270
Stop it!

00:05:01.270 --> 00:05:02.020
Please, stop!

00:05:02.290 --> 00:05:04.490
<i>The previous ruler of the school</i>

00:05:04.490 --> 00:05:07.610
<i>who used to throw his weight 
around, bullying the weak,</i>

00:05:07.610 --> 00:05:11.400
<i>is now crawling on the ground, 
squealing like a pig.</i>

00:05:13.100 --> 00:05:14.600
<i>It's funny...</i>

00:05:14.600 --> 00:05:16.750
<i>It really is funny.</i>

00:05:18.300 --> 00:05:22.180
<i>Is this the thrill that comes 
of seeing justice done?</i>

00:05:22.930 --> 00:05:24.410
<i>It feels so...</i>

00:05:25.100 --> 00:05:26.910
<i>so very good.</i>

00:05:28.000 --> 00:05:29.580
<i>Just you wait.</i>

00:05:31.440 --> 00:05:35.050
<i>I'm going to take revenge</i>

00:05:35.050 --> 00:05:37.700
<i>on every single person 
who's bullied me.</i>

00:05:38.440 --> 00:05:42.300
Officer! Officer!

00:05:43.300 --> 00:05:44.290
You asshole.

00:05:44.290 --> 00:05:45.300
Give him more!

00:05:45.300 --> 00:05:46.340
Damn pig!

00:05:46.340 --> 00:05:48.280
I've been waiting a long time for this!

00:05:50.900 --> 00:05:52.920
Everything's going according to plan.

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:57.110
It's all moving just as I'd hoped.

00:06:03.420 --> 00:06:04.610
Time to go home.

00:06:04.610 --> 00:06:05.570
We'll resume here tomorrow.

00:06:05.570 --> 00:06:07.430
Yes, sir!

00:06:07.650 --> 00:06:09.430
Head Instructor?

00:06:09.630 --> 00:06:13.920
I heard you confiscated a student's 
cell phone during afternoon practice.

00:06:16.300 --> 00:06:18.170
If that's true,

00:06:18.170 --> 00:06:21.100
you can leave it with me.

00:06:21.100 --> 00:06:23.440
That is my duty, after all.

00:06:24.260 --> 00:06:26.980
You don't have any objections, do you?

00:06:36.800 --> 00:06:37.940
What's all this?

00:06:37.940 --> 00:06:38.890
Head Instructor,

00:06:38.890 --> 00:06:42.500
your teachings and the 
encouragement of my classmates

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:45.360
have convinced me to repent 
for my wrongdoings,

00:06:45.360 --> 00:06:49.810
so I went to Wudo-senpai, 
as discipline officer,

00:06:49.810 --> 00:06:51.380
to ask him for further guidance,

00:06:51.380 --> 00:06:54.110
but I found his room full 
of smuggled cell phones.

00:06:54.110 --> 00:06:56.040
It was a clear violation of school rules.

00:06:56.040 --> 00:06:57.800
I warned him that he should

00:06:57.800 --> 00:07:00.930
surrender these dangerous items 
so as not to betray your trust in him.

00:07:01.300 --> 00:07:03.010
But not only did he 
not heed my warning,

00:07:03.010 --> 00:07:04.760
he invited me to join him!

00:07:05.050 --> 00:07:06.440
When I refused,

00:07:06.440 --> 00:07:08.920
he sent all of class one after us.

00:07:08.920 --> 00:07:12.760
But thanks to the unity 
of class four and your teachings,

00:07:12.760 --> 00:07:15.610
we successfully taught 
class one a lesson.

00:07:16.900 --> 00:07:20.000
But I accept responsibility for fighting.

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:21.920
I request strict punishment for my crime.

00:07:26.640 --> 00:07:28.060
You idiot!

00:07:28.060 --> 00:07:30.260
Mocking your head instructor...

00:07:30.260 --> 00:07:31.430
You want to die?

00:07:34.290 --> 00:07:35.710
You bastard...

00:07:35.710 --> 00:07:37.770
You're getting a week in the hole!

00:07:37.770 --> 00:07:40.020
Go on, drag him away!

00:07:40.020 --> 00:07:42.440
I'll interrogate him personally later!

00:07:49.090 --> 00:07:50.560
Well done.

00:07:50.560 --> 00:07:52.700
Repenting shows character.

00:07:52.700 --> 00:07:53.910
I have high expectations of you.

00:07:57.410 --> 00:08:00.410
Headmistress's Office

00:07:57.410 --> 00:08:00.410
This really is a wonderful school.

00:08:00.410 --> 00:08:01.670
I'm very sorry about what happened...

00:08:01.850 --> 00:08:02.550
Excuse me.

00:08:02.550 --> 00:08:05.100
He came home out of the blue,

00:08:05.100 --> 00:08:07.260
swearing that he had reformed.

00:08:07.260 --> 00:08:08.910
We believed him, but...

00:08:08.920 --> 00:08:12.870
He still stays locked in his room 
and won't leave his computer.

00:08:12.870 --> 00:08:14.420
We're out of options as parents.

00:08:14.420 --> 00:08:16.630
We're pinning all our hopes on this school.

00:08:16.630 --> 00:08:20.410
We'll pay anything if it means you'll fix him.

00:08:20.980 --> 00:08:23.440
Your child is physically weak,

00:08:23.440 --> 00:08:25.440
and he has trouble dealing with pressure.

00:08:25.440 --> 00:08:29.840
It's only natural he has trouble acclimating 
to strict, military-style training.

00:08:29.840 --> 00:08:32.060
If you trust and help us,

00:08:32.060 --> 00:08:37.420
we can turn your child 
into a fine human being.

00:08:37.980 --> 00:08:39.300
Thank you.

00:08:39.300 --> 00:08:40.170
We're counting on you.

00:08:40.170 --> 00:08:42.290
Certainly. Leave it to me.

00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:46.970
I'm certain you'll be satisfied with 
the changes in your son a year from now.

00:08:46.970 --> 00:08:48.440
Well, let's go.

00:08:48.440 --> 00:08:50.400
We need to get you re-registered.

00:08:55.100 --> 00:08:57.930
Parents will pay anything 
to help their children, won't they?

00:08:59.090 --> 00:09:00.290
Shian.

00:09:00.290 --> 00:09:02.010
He was your student, wasn't he?

00:09:02.010 --> 00:09:03.430
Keep a firm hand on him.

00:09:06.200 --> 00:09:07.690
I'm sorry, Headmistress.

00:09:07.690 --> 00:09:09.950
I slipped up.

00:09:11.520 --> 00:09:12.940
It's been a while,

00:09:13.500 --> 00:09:16.910
but you may need a little 
punishment of your own.

00:09:21.190 --> 00:09:23.910
This world is brimming with sin.

00:09:24.810 --> 00:09:27.600
All people carry sin deep inside them.

00:09:27.600 --> 00:09:31.960
The only thing that can prevent 
their fall is physical suffering.

00:09:31.960 --> 00:09:35.030
If you want to be saved, 
this is what you need!

00:09:38.220 --> 00:09:39.990
Cry!

00:09:39.990 --> 00:09:41.430
Repent!

00:09:41.910 --> 00:09:44.940
Pathetic, unworthy sinner!

00:09:49.330 --> 00:09:50.380
Well?

00:09:50.380 --> 00:09:52.410
Do you feel saved?

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:01.400
Does your sin feel lighter now?

00:10:03.810 --> 00:10:05.900
Don't forget this sensation.

00:10:06.380 --> 00:10:08.410
Now, we need to get to saving

00:10:09.740 --> 00:10:11.920
even more fallen souls.

00:10:21.090 --> 00:10:22.580
Let me out!

00:10:22.580 --> 00:10:25.420
Please, let me out!

00:10:26.430 --> 00:10:29.810
I'm begging you!

00:10:30.980 --> 00:10:32.300
Instructor Ryo!

00:10:32.300 --> 00:10:33.490
Let me out!

00:10:33.490 --> 00:10:35.310
Hibiki set me up!

00:10:35.310 --> 00:10:36.580
Don't worry!

00:10:36.580 --> 00:10:39.210
If you let me out, 
I can get back the phones!

00:10:39.210 --> 00:10:40.100
Huh?

00:10:40.100 --> 00:10:41.260
Hey, Wudo,

00:10:41.260 --> 00:10:43.330
what are you talking about?

00:10:43.830 --> 00:10:48.900
The commotion today was the first 
I heard about the cell phones...

00:10:48.900 --> 00:10:51.380
Instructor, I'm sorry.

00:10:51.380 --> 00:10:52.330
Please forgive me.

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:57.070
But the cell phone business 
benefits you, too, right?

00:10:57.070 --> 00:10:59.320
Don't be so cruel!

00:11:00.620 --> 00:11:02.200
I suppose that's true.

00:11:02.200 --> 00:11:05.620
So, the word that you were 
rough with that girl named Jun...

00:11:05.620 --> 00:11:06.810
Is that true?

00:11:07.210 --> 00:11:08.990
Instructor, listen to me!

00:11:08.990 --> 00:11:12.320
That girl, Jun, was smuggling a cell phone!

00:11:12.690 --> 00:11:17.010
As discipline officer, I couldn't let that slip!

00:11:17.010 --> 00:11:18.030
That's why...

00:11:18.030 --> 00:11:20.070
I thought she needed punishment.

00:11:23.580 --> 00:11:25.600
Where is that cell phone?

00:11:26.520 --> 00:11:28.220
Um...

00:11:30.030 --> 00:11:31.450
I asked you where it is!

00:11:31.450 --> 00:11:32.720
W-Well...

00:11:32.720 --> 00:11:34.850
Shin stole it.

00:11:34.850 --> 00:11:37.930
Shin gave it to Shiori, and then...

00:11:37.930 --> 00:11:40.840
it was confiscated by 
the head instructor, so...

00:11:40.840 --> 00:11:43.340
The head instructor must have it now!

00:11:45.420 --> 00:11:47.300
Is that how it is?

00:11:49.290 --> 00:11:50.390
That's enough.

00:11:50.390 --> 00:11:53.720
I'll let Instructor Shian 
handle your interrogation.

00:11:55.010 --> 00:11:58.530
No... Instructor Ryo, that's too much!

00:11:58.530 --> 00:12:00.500
What's going on?

00:11:59.090 --> 00:12:00.500
That idiot.

00:12:00.800 --> 00:12:03.010
All he does is cause trouble.

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:05.850
That's enough.

00:12:05.850 --> 00:12:07.090
Clean him up.

00:12:07.090 --> 00:12:07.980
Yes, sir.

00:12:08.790 --> 00:12:10.820
<i>Damn Shin...</i>

00:12:10.820 --> 00:12:13.400
<i>So he's the cause of all of this.</i>

00:12:13.400 --> 00:12:14.170
What?

00:12:14.610 --> 00:12:16.000
This isn't my phone.

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:17.200
Explain yourself.

00:12:17.200 --> 00:12:20.340
You mean Instructor Shian gave me a fake?

00:12:20.340 --> 00:12:21.480
He tricked me?

00:12:22.190 --> 00:12:23.700
I'll use this for now,

00:12:23.700 --> 00:12:26.640
but recover my cell phone at once.

00:12:28.310 --> 00:12:30.000
<i>That damned Instructor Shian...</i>

00:12:30.720 --> 00:12:33.450
<i>He pretends to be such a hard-ass...</i>

00:12:34.010 --> 00:12:37.900
<i>But behind the scenes, 
he's playing sub to the headmistress...</i>

00:12:38.090 --> 00:12:42.690
<i>I'll make sure he pays real soon.</i>

00:12:44.340 --> 00:12:46.520
I almost peed myself back there.

00:12:47.000 --> 00:12:48.520
But it went pretty well.

00:12:48.520 --> 00:12:50.500
If Wudo and his gang had caught me,

00:12:50.500 --> 00:12:52.090
I would have been beaten black and blue.

00:12:52.090 --> 00:12:53.760
Then when I confronted 
the head instructor,

00:12:53.760 --> 00:12:57.330
my knees were knocking and 
my heart almost leaped out my throat.

00:12:57.330 --> 00:12:58.580
Hey, Shin.

00:12:58.580 --> 00:13:01.100
How did you know Wudo 
had cell phones on him?

00:13:01.100 --> 00:13:03.000
And so many of them...

00:13:03.560 --> 00:13:05.800
When you spend enough time here,

00:13:05.800 --> 00:13:07.930
you'll learn these things, too.

00:13:07.930 --> 00:13:09.480
Anyway, you made it through.

00:13:09.900 --> 00:13:12.480
I'll acknowledge you as a co-conspirator.

00:13:12.480 --> 00:13:15.730
Don't get cocky, though.

00:13:15.730 --> 00:13:18.020
Things are just getting started.

00:13:21.980 --> 00:13:23.840
This is my room.

00:13:23.840 --> 00:13:26.480
It'll be our headquarters 
for the current operation, too.

00:13:27.380 --> 00:13:28.700
Go in.

00:13:32.770 --> 00:13:34.840
Th-This is your room?

00:13:36.840 --> 00:13:39.210
It's so nice!

00:13:39.210 --> 00:13:40.450
Calm down.

00:13:40.450 --> 00:13:42.900
I bought a few upgrades, that's all.

00:13:43.510 --> 00:13:44.600
Well?

00:13:44.600 --> 00:13:45.840
Want to live with me?

00:13:45.840 --> 00:13:47.220
Well...

00:13:47.890 --> 00:13:50.740
I've been wondering since we first met...

00:13:50.740 --> 00:13:52.800
Just who are you?

00:13:52.800 --> 00:13:54.980
I'm your master,

00:13:54.980 --> 00:13:56.190
Hibiki-chan.

00:13:56.190 --> 00:13:57.440
Stop playing around!

00:13:57.440 --> 00:13:59.190
Talk to me seriously!

00:14:01.100 --> 00:14:06.320
I wanted to celebrate 
your defeat of Wudo.

00:14:07.600 --> 00:14:09.920
Thanks.

00:14:10.600 --> 00:14:15.330
Making you fight Wudo 
was meant as a test of sorts.

00:14:16.100 --> 00:14:20.280
And I thought I could teach you 
the rules of the school while I was at it.

00:14:20.280 --> 00:14:22.300
Test? Rules?

00:14:22.300 --> 00:14:24.010
Yeah. Ready?

00:14:24.010 --> 00:14:25.120
Think back carefully.

00:14:25.520 --> 00:14:27.060
What happened last night?

00:14:27.840 --> 00:14:29.450
Now that you mention it,

00:14:29.450 --> 00:14:31.590
despite all the chaos,

00:14:31.590 --> 00:14:34.100
no instructors interfered...

00:14:34.100 --> 00:14:36.860
I figure you've bought off Bin,

00:14:36.860 --> 00:14:38.800
but why didn't the other instructors...

00:14:39.840 --> 00:14:41.310
Precisely.

00:14:41.310 --> 00:14:42.980
Here. Toast.

00:14:47.020 --> 00:14:49.320
Wh-What, exactly, is going on?

00:14:49.510 --> 00:14:51.850
You know enough for now.

00:14:51.850 --> 00:14:53.760
Now you're ready to roll, right?

00:14:53.760 --> 00:14:56.130
Let's get to planning the next stage.

00:14:56.490 --> 00:14:59.820
Our next target is class six.

00:15:00.300 --> 00:15:01.890
Um, Yoh-san.

00:15:01.890 --> 00:15:03.320
Could I have a minute?

00:15:06.970 --> 00:15:08.340
Hurry it up.

00:15:11.010 --> 00:15:13.810
Hey. Next one.

00:15:15.800 --> 00:15:17.180
You're kidding, right?

00:15:17.180 --> 00:15:19.570
There are other people running trades?

00:15:19.570 --> 00:15:20.750
Of course.

00:15:20.750 --> 00:15:22.870
The school is totally sealed off.

00:15:22.870 --> 00:15:25.810
If instructors and staff weren't helping 
the students behind the scenes,

00:15:26.260 --> 00:15:29.800
how could they possibly 
get so many cell phones?

00:15:30.080 --> 00:15:33.330
Wudo was merely 
one of those students.

00:15:33.900 --> 00:15:36.570
What have I gotten myself into?

00:15:36.570 --> 00:15:38.200
It's a bit late for doubts.

00:15:38.200 --> 00:15:40.820
Instructor Shian has high expectations for you.

00:15:41.270 --> 00:15:45.150
You need to find every student 
with a hidden cell phone

00:15:45.150 --> 00:15:47.150
and report them to him.

00:15:47.150 --> 00:15:49.730
If you do, you'll earn his trust,

00:15:49.730 --> 00:15:52.340
and the other students will 
acknowledge your superiority.

00:15:53.500 --> 00:15:56.800
Then if Shiori begs you for a cell phone,

00:15:57.380 --> 00:16:00.490
it'll be easy to get her one.

00:16:03.500 --> 00:16:04.820
<i>I guess that's true.</i>

00:16:06.840 --> 00:16:11.980
The truth is, I smuggled out a cell 
phone in the chaos yesterday.

00:16:12.850 --> 00:16:15.440
If I give it to Shiori...

00:16:17.130 --> 00:16:20.450
Hibiki-chan, you're so stupid.

00:16:21.010 --> 00:16:22.340
What?

00:16:22.580 --> 00:16:25.250
Have you forgotten?

00:16:25.840 --> 00:16:28.130
Even if you give Shiori that cell phone,

00:16:28.130 --> 00:16:30.690
she'll still treat you like trash.

00:16:33.600 --> 00:16:37.300
Don't forget, just yesterday, 
you were a pathetic loser.

00:16:37.670 --> 00:16:40.320
If you never want to be treated 
like garbage again,

00:16:40.730 --> 00:16:43.330
show everyone how 
serious you can get.

00:16:45.680 --> 00:16:46.890
Fine.

00:16:48.200 --> 00:16:53.520
A power struggle at this 
school has been triggered.

00:16:53.830 --> 00:16:57.520
As the one who defeated Wudo, 
you'll be a key figure in that.

00:16:58.000 --> 00:16:59.320
Listen.

00:16:59.650 --> 00:17:02.230
I'll help you in any way I can.

00:17:02.230 --> 00:17:07.430
But whether you can rise 
out of the garbage to stand

00:17:07.430 --> 00:17:12.230
at the top of this rotten 
prison of a school is all up to you.

00:17:26.600 --> 00:17:27.990
Shu...

00:17:30.410 --> 00:17:32.810
Wow, a D-cup!

00:17:32.810 --> 00:17:34.310
What are you doing?

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:40.450
Hey, that hurt!

00:17:46.420 --> 00:17:48.630
Don't pick on Big Sis!

00:17:49.660 --> 00:17:51.120
What did you say?

00:17:52.500 --> 00:17:53.840
Fight me!

00:18:13.040 --> 00:18:15.730
Do you remember where 
class six does its business?

00:18:15.730 --> 00:18:18.130
They're a pretty cunning group.

00:18:18.130 --> 00:18:22.320
The leader, Yoh, will be harder 
to deal with than Wudo.

00:18:22.990 --> 00:18:24.910
It's lunch break right now.

00:18:25.250 --> 00:18:28.660
Take your allies and
 find out more about him.

00:18:29.050 --> 00:18:29.840
<i>Shiori.</i>

00:18:30.440 --> 00:18:32.840
<i>I'll become someone you can rely on.</i>

00:18:33.090 --> 00:18:35.840
Look alive, everyone! It's time to fight!

00:18:40.090 --> 00:18:42.290
Leader, do we have to fight again?

00:18:42.290 --> 00:18:44.700
We're afraid of fighting!

00:18:44.700 --> 00:18:46.130
Yesterday we only joined you

00:18:46.130 --> 00:18:49.850
because we wanted to drag 
Wudo off his high horse.

00:18:49.860 --> 00:18:51.320
Now we've had enough.

00:18:52.250 --> 00:18:54.320
I'm tired and sleepy.

00:18:54.320 --> 00:18:56.300
G-Give me a break.

00:18:56.300 --> 00:18:58.820
I got beaten up by Wudo, too.

00:18:58.820 --> 00:19:02.220
Earning the trust of the head instructor 
will give us an advantage, right?

00:19:02.220 --> 00:19:05.320
If we take advantage of this chance, 
we can control the school.

00:19:06.120 --> 00:19:07.960
What are you thinking?

00:19:07.960 --> 00:19:11.840
Don't order us around 
after what you put us through!

00:19:12.150 --> 00:19:14.290
You think you're hot stuff, huh?

00:19:14.290 --> 00:19:16.330
I haven't liked you since we first met.

00:19:16.330 --> 00:19:17.420
Now I'm gonna pound you into—

00:19:16.730 --> 00:19:18.300
Hey, cut it out.

00:19:18.300 --> 00:19:20.340
No point in fighting your own roommates.

00:19:20.340 --> 00:19:22.300
We just got lucky yesterday.

00:19:22.300 --> 00:19:25.300
I'm sick of walking this 
dangerous line with you.

00:19:25.800 --> 00:19:27.660
What happens if the instructors find out?

00:19:27.660 --> 00:19:30.320
If we're beaten and locked up, 
I won't be able to take it.

00:19:31.510 --> 00:19:33.540
I just wanna go home!

00:19:35.210 --> 00:19:36.510
Don't worry.

00:19:36.510 --> 00:19:39.320
If you do just as I say, 
the instructors won't find out.

00:19:39.580 --> 00:19:41.140
Do as you say?

00:19:41.140 --> 00:19:42.700
Who do you think you are?

00:19:42.700 --> 00:19:44.650
If you want to do it, do it yourself.

00:19:44.650 --> 00:19:45.830
Hey.

00:19:46.930 --> 00:19:50.170
Listen, Hibiki. I don't want to be harsh.

00:19:50.170 --> 00:19:51.800
Just let sleeping dogs lie.

00:19:51.800 --> 00:19:55.000
If you do as you're told, 
you'll be out in a year.

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:57.330
So don't do anything 
crazy before then, okay?

00:19:57.810 --> 00:19:59.370
Let's get some rest.

00:19:59.370 --> 00:20:01.510
We've got training in the afternoon, too.

00:20:02.570 --> 00:20:05.110
What the hell, you stubborn assholes?

00:20:05.110 --> 00:20:06.950
I guess there's no point 
in saving you, then.

00:20:07.190 --> 00:20:08.980
You can all stay losers forever.

00:20:10.690 --> 00:20:14.380
I'm done being your leader!

00:20:16.810 --> 00:20:18.820
Input Password

00:20:21.560 --> 00:20:22.820
Come in.

00:20:23.900 --> 00:20:25.270
My, my.

00:20:25.270 --> 00:20:27.170
If it isn't Instructor Ryo.

00:20:27.500 --> 00:20:31.110
What brings you all the way here?

00:20:31.720 --> 00:20:33.010
Hey, Shin...

00:20:35.190 --> 00:20:36.410
Hoku!

00:20:38.420 --> 00:20:40.040
As expected

00:20:40.040 --> 00:20:43.920
from the popular former
 student council president,

00:20:43.920 --> 00:20:45.180
Shiori.

00:20:45.180 --> 00:20:47.380
You're quite impressive.

00:20:50.290 --> 00:20:52.610
Sorry about that.

00:20:52.610 --> 00:20:54.490
I wanted to test you

00:20:54.490 --> 00:20:56.700
to see if you're as good as they say.

00:20:56.700 --> 00:20:58.400
Who are you people?

00:20:59.400 --> 00:21:00.900
I'll tell you.

00:21:00.900 --> 00:21:02.290
I'm Akane.

00:21:02.290 --> 00:21:04.000
This is my little sister, Hoku.

00:21:04.000 --> 00:21:06.400
Together, we lead class eighteen.

00:21:06.850 --> 00:21:08.320
What do you want with me?

00:21:09.550 --> 00:21:12.570
We want to unite the 
three girls' classes into one.

00:21:12.570 --> 00:21:15.500
Then, we want to unite the whole school.

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:19.460
Even if you're not student 
council president anymore,

00:21:19.900 --> 00:21:22.550
you still have lots of influence in class nineteen.

00:21:22.550 --> 00:21:24.430
Well? Want to work with us?

00:21:26.300 --> 00:21:27.720
Foolishness.

00:21:27.720 --> 00:21:29.890
I don't have time to play 
along with your game.

00:21:29.890 --> 00:21:32.770
Come on, at least think 
about it a little first!

00:21:32.770 --> 00:21:35.760
And if you join us...

00:21:40.000 --> 00:21:42.900
Hey... Calm down a little.

00:21:43.490 --> 00:21:45.740
If anything happens to me,

00:21:45.740 --> 00:21:47.840
you'll be in big trouble.

00:21:47.840 --> 00:21:49.930
You're dead either way.

00:21:49.930 --> 00:21:52.120
I'm just speeding things up a bit.

00:21:52.120 --> 00:21:52.910
Talk!

00:21:53.160 --> 00:21:55.220
Where is Jun's cell phone?

00:23:25.960 --> 00:23:39.970
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

00:23:26.510 --> 00:23:27.520
Let me go.

00:23:27.520 --> 00:23:29.250
How dare you put your hands on me?!

00:23:28.930 --> 00:23:30.390
Calm down.

00:23:29.520 --> 00:23:31.110
You want me to kill you?!

00:23:30.500 --> 00:23:32.150
A dog who won't listen to orders...

00:23:32.150 --> 00:23:34.450
Only a small portion 
of them are in the wrong.

00:23:34.450 --> 00:23:37.480
It's not fair that we should 
all be made to suffer.

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:39.980
Episode 6
Further Into Darkness

00:23:37.740 --> 00:23:39.730
Let's help each other.
